var-only top-level parameter swept as a circuit variable
ground 0
load "resistor.osdi"
model resistor resistor
model vsource vsource
v1 (a 0) vsource dc=1
r1 (a b) resistor r=rval
r2 (b 0) resistor r=1k
control
  options rawfile="ascii"
  var rval=1k
  analysis op0 op
  sweep s1 variable="rval" values=[1k, 3k]
    analysis op1 op
  analysis op2 op
endc
